{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19254","headline":"赠同年陈长史员外 · 刘禹锡","name":"赠同年陈长史员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"明州长史外台郎，忆昔同年翰墨场。\n一自分襟多岁月，相逢满眼是凄凉。\n推贤有愧韩安国，论旧唯存盛孝章。\n所叹谬游东阁下，看君无计出恓惶。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19254.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19254","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}